  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:303:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:304:GCSE FILM STUDIES
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:305:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:306:1  INTRODUCTION
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:307:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:308:1.1  Aims and objectives
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:309:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:310:Film is an important part of many people's lives.  Those who choose to study it
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:311:characteristically bring with them a huge enthusiasm and excitement for film which
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:312:constantly motivates them in their studies.  They experience a powerful medium
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:313:which inspires a range of responses from the emotional to the reflective as they are
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:314:drawn into characters, their narratives and the issues films raise.  The root of that
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:315:power is the immersive audio-visual experience film offers – one which can exploit
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:316:striking cinematography, composition and locations as well as powerful music and
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:317:sound.  It is not surprising that many consider film to be the major art form of the last
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:318:hundred years and that many feel it important to study a medium which has such a
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:319:significant influence on the way people think and feel.
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:320:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:321:The WJEC Eduqas specification in GCSE Film Studies is designed to draw on
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:322:learners' enthusiasm for film and introduce them to a wide variety of cinematic
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:323:experiences through films which have been important in the development of film and
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:324:film technology.  Learners will develop their knowledge of US mainstream film by
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:325:studying one film from the 1950s and one film from the later 70s and 80s, thus
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:326:looking at two stages in Hollywood's development.  In addition, they will be studying
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:327:more recent films – a US independent film as well as films from Europe, including the
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:328:UK, South Africa and Australia.
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:329:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:330:Set films are reviewed and updated every three to five years. Centres will be notified
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:331:of any specification updates via circulars sent to centres.
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:332:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:333:Production is an important part of this specification and is integral to learners' study
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:334:of film.   Studying a diverse range of films from several different contexts is designed
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:335:to give learners the opportunity to apply their knowledge and understanding of how
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:336:films are constructed to their own filmmaking and screenwriting.  This is intended to
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:337:support learners in producing creative films and screenplays as well as enable their
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:338:production work to provide an informed filmmaker's perspective on their own study of
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:339:film.
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:340:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:341:The academic study of film is now well established and the frameworks for its study
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:342:are broadly similar whether at GCSE, AS, A level or at higher education institutions.
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:343:The WJEC Eduqas specification in GCSE Film Studies aims to develop knowledge
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:344:and understanding of:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:345:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:346:the ways in which meanings and responses are generated through film
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:347:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:348:•
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:349:•  a contrasting, culturally diverse range of films from different national contexts
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:350:•
