  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1075:•  one UK film, from a choice of three, produced since 2010.
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1076:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1077:As with Component 1, all films must be studied in relation to the core study areas set
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1078:out in detail in the introduction to this section:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1079:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1080:1.   the key elements of film form (cinematography, mise-en-scène, editing and
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1081:
