  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1645:Production
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1646:In order to ensure the authenticity and comparability of all learners' production work,
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1647:teachers are required to establish the following conditions for production (set out
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1648:below).
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1649:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1650:Learners and teachers may carry out the following:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1651:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1652:•
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1653:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1654:•
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1655:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1656:•
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1657:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1658:learners may use any filmmaking or screenwriting ideas they may have learnt
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1659:about during their course of study and collected in their portfolio
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1660:teachers may provide general advice about areas of possible improvement for
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1661:plans, drafts or, in the case of a film extract, an initial edit provided the learner
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1662:is responsible for completing all work
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1663:teachers may also provide general advice about areas of possible
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1664:improvement for the production phase of either the film or the screenplay and
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1665:illustrative shooting script.
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1666:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1667:Teachers must not provide specific or detailed guidance on how to make possible
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1668:improvements they advise on or make any creative decisions for learners.
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1669:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1670:Learners must complete the following authenticating stages:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1671:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1672:•  stage 1: learners must submit to the teacher evidence of initial planning
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1673:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1674:(taking the form of outline ideas and possible examples of work to inform the
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1675:production)
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1676:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1677:•  stage 2: learners must submit to the teacher evidence of a plan for the film
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1678:extract (for example, an outline storyboard) or a plan for the screenplay (for
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1679:example, an outline draft and a draft storyboard of a key section of the
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1680:screenplay)
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1681:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1682:•  stage 3: learners must submit to the teacher evidence of the progress of the
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1683:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1684:production at a suitable point during the production (e.g. an initial edit or draft)
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1685:so that the teacher can be assured of the work's authenticity
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1686:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1687:•  stage 4: learners must confirm that camerawork and editing or the screenplay
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1688:and its accompanying illustrative shooting script is the learner's own unaided
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1689:work.
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1690:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1691:•  stage 5: learners must submit to the teacher evidence of instructions to any
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1692:unassessed assistants who provide independent sound or lighting for a film
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1693:production.  Both the teacher and the unassessed sound and/or lighting
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1694:assistants are required to confirm that their unassessed role was under the
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1695:direction of the assessed learner.
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1696:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1697:•  Note: performance is not assessed.  Unassessed participants who act in, or
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1698:appear in, the production are not therefore required to confirm their role.
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1699:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1700:Teachers are not required to supervise directly the production of either a film and its
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1701:editing or a screenplay and its shooting script.   However, they must be able to
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1702:monitor and recognise the continuity between all the authenticating stages of the
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1703:production.  They should be able to recognise the continuity between:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1704:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1705:the first plan or draft (stage 2)
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1706:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1707:•  evidence of initial planning (stage 1)
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1708:•
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1709:•  evidence of an initial edit or draft of the production phase (stage 3)
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1710:•
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1711:
  C:\Users\tshau\Documents\Study Vault\specs\eduqas\film-studies-C670QS.md:1712:the completed outcome.
